501 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Current LLIE evaluation was performed on a frame-by-frame, realtime basis. Due to real-time SLAM sensitivity to temporal consistency between consecutive frames, future analysis should investigate methods to introduce robust temporal stability.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
502 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Integration of Additional Sensors \(Stereo/Depth\))
/E (Integration of Additional Sensors \(Stereo/Depth\))
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
503 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Expanding beyond monocular input, future work should incorporate stereo vision and depth sensors \(e.g., Intel RealSense D435i\). Combining LLIE with multi-view geometry could improve depth estimation and feature triangulation in low-light conditions, providing richer scene structure and reducing scale drift in dark or texture-poor environments.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
